Subject: [PATCH] share original NIS camera timing and trigger crossing arithmetic
Upstream-base: f75ccf1ad20e5bd7585962990db08067c0ae498a

Extract the original frame product/clamp/carry ordering, positive primary carry
and half-open trigger crossing into shared inline helpers. The original methods
and the bounded native camera/trigger scheduler use those exact expressions.
No actor, asynchronous-loading, audio, overlay or complete NisPlayer service is
selected by this extraction. Input validation belongs to the native owner.

